OL,3,GNEWSATrust running former national
OL,4,Acostume museum to cease trading
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust which took over Scotland's
OL,7,Fformer national museum of costume has
OL,8,Fannounced it will cease trading in
OL,9,FJanuary.
OL,11,FShambellie House at New Abbey near
OL,12,FDumfries closed in 2013, with its
OL,13,Fcontents transferred to Edinburgh.
OL,15,FA trust was set up two years later to
OL,16,Ffind a new use for the building and it
OL,17,Fwas handed over in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
