OL,3,GNEWSATrust running former national
OL,4,Acostume museum to cease trading
OL,5,
OL,6,FShambellie House Trust (SHT)
OL,7,Fvice-chair, Ann Hill, said it was
OL,8,Fsolvent, but insurance, heating and
OL,9,Felectricity were too expensive. If a
OL,10,Fnew charity cannot be found to take
OL,11,Fover the site, it will be sold and the
OL,12,Fproceeds returned to the Scottish
OL,13,Fgovernment.
